# Modern Type-Safe Navigation

- Always implement a single, centralized `NavHost` inside the main App Composable.
- Define destinations using the modern Compose Navigation Type-Safety approach (using `@Serializable` objects or data classes). Avoid old string-based routes or custom sealed class wrappers.
- Pass lambda parameters (e.g., `onNavigateToDetails: (AssetId) -> Unit`) to screen composables to keep them isolated, decoupled, and 100% previewable.
- Expand the app incrementally: update the existing `NavHost` configuration without modifying or breaking older, completed screens.
